#: device/crafter.md
msgid "Crafter"
msgstr ""

#: device/crafter.md
msgid "Device name: `crafter`"
msgstr ""

#: device/crafter.md
msgid "Provided by crafters connected to a [bus interface]({1}). The grid slots are available through the [item handler]({2}) device."
msgstr ""

#: device/crafter.md
msgid "Gets what the crafter would currently craft."
msgstr ""

#: device/crafter.md
msgid "Returns a table with the item information. Returns nothing if the grid matches no recipe."
msgstr ""

#: device/crafter.md
msgid "Gets whether a slot of the grid is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: device/crafter.md
msgid "`slot`: the slot index."
msgstr ""

#: device/crafter.md
msgid "Returns `true` if the slot is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: device/crafter.md
msgid "Sets whether a grid slot is enabled. Slot must be empty to be disabled."
