#: device/crafting.md
msgid "Crafting"
msgstr ""

#: device/crafting.md
msgid "Device name: `crafting`"
msgstr ""

#: device/crafting.md
msgid "Provided by the [crafting module]({1}) to robots."
msgstr ""

#: device/crafting.md
