msgid "Tries to drop items from the selected slot into the specified slot of an inventory in the specified direction. Items are only dropped into an inventory, never into the world."
msgstr ""

#: device/inventory_operations.md
msgid "`intoSlot`: the slot to insert items into."
msgstr ""

#: device/inventory_operations.md
#: device/transposer.md
msgid "Gets how many slots the inventory on the specified side has."
