#: device/serial.md
msgid "Gets how many received bytes were lost because this computer did not read them in time."
msgstr ""

#: device/serial.md
msgid "Returns the number of bytes lost since the computer started."
msgstr ""

#: device/serial.md
msgid "Gets how often received data was corrupted because several endpoints sent at the same time. These are the collisions the receiver sees."
msgstr ""

#: device/serial.md
